<Legal title="Terms of Use | Stonecroft Renovation" description="Terms for using the Stonecroft Renovation website, budget estimator and published build logs." heading="Terms of use" updated="2026-10-16" crumb="Terms">
  <p class="rounded-sm border border-clay bg-clay-tint p-4 text-[15px]"><strong>Draft for legal review.</strong> These terms must be reviewed by a BC lawyer before launch.</p>
  <p>These terms govern your use of this website, operated by {company.legalName}, registration {company.registration}. They do not govern a renovation contract; that is a separate signed document.</p>
  <h2>Prices and ranges on this site</h2>
  <p>The price ranges, the budget estimator and the schedule estimator are planning tools based on our recent completed work. They are not quotes or offers. A fixed price is only given in a written proposal after a site visit.</p>
  <h2>Published build logs</h2>
  <p>Build logs are published with the homeowner's consent. Costs, schedules and change orders are reported accurately at the time of publishing; figures may be corrected and corrections are noted on the entry.</p>
  <h2>Permit and regulatory information</h2>
  <p>Permit timelines and requirements are verified on the date shown and link to the official source. Municipalities change their rules; always confirm with the municipality before relying on them.</p>
  <h2>Content</h2>
  <p>Photographs, text and drawings on this site belong to Stonecroft unless stated. You may link to and quote articles with attribution.</p>
  <h2>Liability</h2>
  <p>We take care to keep this site accurate but provide it "as is". To the extent permitted by law, we are not liable for decisions made on information from this site without a written proposal.</p>
  <h2>Governing law</h2>
  <p>These terms are governed by the laws of British Columbia and the federal laws of Canada that apply there.</p>
</Legal>
